@page "/accessibility"
<PageTitle>DockLayout Accessibility</PageTitle>
<h1>Accessibility</h1>
<ul><li>Tab strips use role=tablist and roving tabindex.</li><li>Toolbars use role=toolbar and aria-expanded.</li><li>Splitters use role=separator and keyboard arrows.</li><li>Ctrl+Tab switches tabs; Ctrl+W closes the active closable tab.</li><li>prefers-reduced-motion disables transitions and animation.</li></ul>
